  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingAssetsAndLiabilitiesIncurredFromTransactionsWithAffiliatedEntitiesTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_NonConsolidatedMember">
&lt;p style="margin-left: 84px; text-align: left; text-indent: -24px"&gt;※２　関係会社に対する金銭債権及び金銭債務&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style="margin-left: 84px"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="table-layout: fixed; width: 564px"&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style="width: 204px"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width: 180px"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width: 180px"/&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style="border-left: 0px none #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 0px none ; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; width: 204px; vertical-align: middle; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: left"&gt;
&lt;span style="font-size: 12px"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
